;Description
:This template is used to link to the Nico Nico Douga original of a song.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{nnd|<number>}}</nowiki></code> nearby the title, and substitute <number> with the latter part of the NND link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

example: {{T|nnd|sm0000000|_Y_=1}}
